      "name": "BinkBufferGetDescription",
      "signature": "char * BinkBufferGetDescription(BinkBuffer * pBinkBuffer)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "char *",
      "comment": "Get descriptive string for Bink video buffer type.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate input buffer pointer for null (return null if invalid)\n2. Read buffer type identifier from offset 0x7c in buffer structure\n3. Switch on buffer type value (1-10) with jump table optimization\n4. Copy appropriate format string to global description buffer\n5. Return pointer to formatted description string\n\nParameters:\npBinkBuffer (BinkBuffer *): Pointer to Bink video buffer structure containing type field at offset 0x7c\n\nReturns:\nchar *: Pointer to null-terminated description string, or null for invalid input\nSuccess values: Pointer to g_szBinkBufferDescription containing format description\nError conditions: null for null input parameter or unrecognized buffer type\n\nBuffer Type Mappings:\nType 1: \"DirectDraw primary surface\" (0x100076a2)\nType 2: \"DIB Section\" (0x100077a2) - copies from s_DibSection constant\nType 3: \"DirectDraw YV12 overlay\" (0x100076bd)\nType 4: \"DirectDraw YUY2 overlay\" (0x100076d8)\nType 5: \"DirectDraw UYVY overlay\" (0x100076f3)\nType 6: \"DirectDraw YV12 off-screen surface\" (0x10007711)\nType 7: \"DirectDraw YUY2 off-screen surface\" (0x1000772f)\nType 8: \"DirectDraw UYVY off-screen surface\" (0x1000774d)\nType 9: \"DirectDraw RGB off-screen video surface\" (0x10007768)\nType 10: \"DirectDraw RGB off-screen system surface\" (0x10007784)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Uses MOVSD.REP for efficient DWORD-aligned string copying\n- Different copy loop counts for different string lengths (6, 8, 10 dwords)\n- Jump table at 0x100077d4 for optimized switch dispatch\n- Global buffer g_szBinkBufferDescription used for all return strings",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "EXP",
      "index": "EXP:5",
