      "name": "TransformBufferWithLookupTable",
      "signature": "int TransformBufferWithLookupTable(int nElementCount, int nReturnBase)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Transforms buffer elements through lookup table conversion.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize loop counter from nElementCount parameter\n2. Read byte from g_pDstBufferCurrent buffer pointer, increment pointer\n3. Use byte as index into lookup table at 0x1003634c (stride 4 bytes)\n4. Store resulting ushort value to g_pSrcBufferCurrent, advance by 2 bytes\n5. Read byte from g_pDstBufferEnd buffer pointer, increment pointer\n6. Use byte as index into lookup table at 0x1003634c (stride 4 bytes)\n7. Store resulting ushort value to g_pSrcBufferEnd, advance by 2 bytes\n8. Decrement loop counter and repeat until zero\n9. Return sum of original parameters (nElementCount + nReturnBase)\n\nParameters:\n  nElementCount (int): Number of elements to transform from source buffers\n  nReturnBase (int): Base value added to element count for return calculation\n\nReturns:\n  int: Sum of nElementCount + nReturnBase for caller verification\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Function assumes valid buffer pointers are set in globals before call\n  - Lookup table at 0x1003634c must contain valid ushort values at 4-byte intervals\n  - Both source and destination buffers are processed simultaneously\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n  0x1003634c: Base address of lookup table (256 entries, 4-byte stride)\n  0x2: Increment value for ushort destination buffer pointers\n  0x1: Increment value for byte source buffer pointers\n\nGlobal Buffer Layout:\n  g_pDstBufferCurrent: Current position in destination input buffer (bytes)\n  g_pDstBufferEnd: Current position in destination end buffer (bytes)\n  g_pSrcBufferCurrent: Current position in source output buffer (ushorts)\n  g_pSrcBufferEnd: Current position in source end output buffer (ushorts)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:91a5e847d365e396cb4038029fe26f37",
