      "name": "BinkCallCompletionCallback",
      "signature": "int BinkCallCompletionCallback(BINK * pBink, uint dwUserData)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Calls the registered completion callback for a Bink video operation.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Read the current operation index from BINK structure at offset 0x48\n2. Check if index is valid (not -1, indicating no operation pending)  \n3. If invalid index, return 0 (no callback executed)\n4. Read callback parameters from BINK structure:\n   - Operation context from offset 0x44\n   - Operation-specific data from array at offset 0x3c using index\n5. Call the global completion callback function pointer with all parameters\n6. Clear the completion flag at offset 0x54 to 0\n7. Reset operation index at offset 0x48 to -1 (invalid)\n8. Return 1 (callback executed successfully)\n\nParameters:\npBink - Pointer to BINK structure containing operation state and callback parameters\ndwUserData - User-provided data passed through to the completion callback function\n\nReturns:\n0 - No callback executed (no pending operation, index was -1)\n1 - Callback executed successfully (operation was pending and callback invoked)\n\nSpecial Cases:\nOperation index of -1 (0xffffffff) indicates no pending operation requiring callback\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x3c - Array base offset in BINK structure for operation-specific data storage\n0x44 - Operation context parameter offset in BINK structure  \n0x48 - Current operation index offset in BINK structure (-1 when invalid)\n0x54 - Completion flag offset in BINK structure (cleared after callback)\n0xffffffff - Invalid operation index marker value (-1 in signed representation)\n\nStructure Layout:\nOffset | Size | Field Name    | Type | Description\n0x3c   | ?    | operationData | int[]| Array of operation-specific data values\n0x44   | 4    | opContext     | int  | Operation context parameter for callback\n0x48   | 4    | opIndex       | int  | Current operation index (-1 if none pending)\n0x54   | 4    | completionFlag| int  | Completion status flag (cleared after callback)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
