      "name": "ApplyAudioEffectProcessing",
      "signature": "void ApplyAudioEffectProcessing(BinkAudioContext * pAudioContext)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Applies audio effect processing to a Bink audio context using coefficient lookup tables\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate audio context - return early if null audio processor object\n2. Load and clamp volume level from context offset 0x1c to maximum 0x7fff\n3. Load frequency/pitch parameter from context offset 0x20\n4. Calculate coefficient index based on frequency parameter:\n   - If frequency <= 0x10000: Use direct calculation with 0x7f multiplier\n   - If frequency > 0x10000: Use negative coefficient from primary table\n5. Apply coefficient bounds checking (-0x18 to 0x18 range)\n6. Call audio processor vtable methods in sequence:\n   - Method at offset 0x44: Apply parameter from context offset 0x10\n   - Method at offset 0x40: Apply calculated coefficient\n   - Method at offset 0x3c: Apply volume-scaled coefficient\n\nParameters:\npAudioContext - Pointer to BinkAudioContext structure containing:\n  - Offset 0x00: Audio processor object pointer with vtable\n  - Offset 0x10: Audio parameter for first vtable method\n  - Offset 0x1c: Volume/gain level (clamped to 0x7fff max)\n  - Offset 0x20: Frequency/pitch parameter for coefficient calculation\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- If audio processor object is null, function returns immediately\n- Volume levels above 0x7fff are clamped to maximum value\n- Coefficients outside range [-0x18, 0x18] are set to zero\n- Uses two coefficient lookup tables for different frequency ranges\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x7fff (32767) - Maximum audio volume/gain level\n0x10000 (65536) - Frequency threshold for coefficient table selection  \n0x7f (127) - Frequency multiplier for coefficient calculation\n0x8000 (32768) - Rounding offset for fixed-point division\n0x44, 0x40, 0x3c - Vtable method offsets for audio processing\n0x18 (24) - Maximum coefficient range limit\n0x1002e350 - Primary coefficient lookup table\n0x1002e54c - Secondary coefficient lookup table\n\nStructure Layout:\nBinkAudioContext (partial):\nOffset  Size  Field Name        Type         Description\n0x00    4     pAudioProcessor   void*        Audio processor object with vtable\n0x10    4     dwAudioParam      uint         Parameter for first vtable method\n0x1c    4     nVolume           int          Volume/gain level (max 0x7fff)\n0x20    4     nFrequency        int          Frequency/pitch for coefficient calc",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "CON",
      "index": "CON:0b35f1f20d0fdfde111e21e8b3decaee",
